#### Expected Behavior
Forex/Crypto conversion rates should be nonzero during warm up.

#### Actual Behavior
Conversion rates for currencies in the cashbook are zero until the end of warm up.

#### Potential Solution
`CashBook.EnsureCurrencyDataFeeds` should be called before the `AlgorithmManager` loop.

#### Reproducing the Problem
This algorithm outputs zero conversion rates during warm up:
``` C#
    public class TestConversionRatesDuringWarmup : QCAlgorithm
    {
        public override void Initialize()
        {
            SetStartDate(2018, 3, 1);  //Set Start Date
            SetEndDate(2018, 3, 1);    //Set End Date
            SetCash(10000);
            SetWarmUp(5);
            AddCrypto("BTCUSD", Resolution.Hour);
        }

        public override void OnData(Slice data)
        {
            Log($"BTC current price: {Securities["BTCUSD"].Price}");
            Log($"BTC conversion rate: {Portfolio.CashBook["BTC"].ConversionRate}");
        }
    }
```

